  id: cindra
  dexNumber: 209
  displayName: Cindra
  lore: A hound that walks on two legs, with hair and tail of open flame. She chooses
    one person and keeps to their heel for good; when she throws back her head and
    howls, everyone on her side stands a little taller.
  personality: Bold, teasing, fiercely loyal.
